.TH lprint-printers 1 "LPrint" "2026-06-03" "Michael R Sweet"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lprint-printers \- list the configured printer queues.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lprint
.B printers
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This command lists the configured label printer queues.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR lprint (1),
.BR lprint-add (1).
